### Code
```python
    if on_hand < 0:
        raise ValueError(f"on_hand must be non-negative, got {on_hand}")
```

### Feedback
Move the on_hand validation into a small helper, _require_non_negative(on_hand), and call it from low_stock_message; other inventory alerts will need the same check.

